{"page":236,"width":1704,"height":2288,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"하지만 함수 포인터를 이용하여 호출하는 경우에는 함수의 구현을 미리 알지 않아도 된「나는 장점이 있습니다","words":[{"text":"하지만","x":273,"y":253,"width":81,"height":28},{"text":"함수","x":363,"y":253,"width":51,"height":27},{"text":"포인터를","x":421,"y":252,"width":102,"height":27},{"text":"이용하여","x":532,"y":251,"width":99,"height":29},{"text":"호출하는","x":640,"y":251,"width":100,"height":28},{"text":"경우에는","x":748,"y":252,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"함수의","x":856,"y":251,"width":74,"height":28},{"text":"구현을","x":939,"y":250,"width":76,"height":29},{"text":"미리","x":1025,"y":250,"width":47,"height":28},{"text":"알지","x":1083,"y":249,"width":50,"height":28},{"text":"않아도","x":1142,"y":249,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"된「나는","x":1225,"y":249,"width":73,"height":27},{"text":"장점이","x":1306,"y":248,"width":74,"height":29},{"text":"있습니다","x":1388,"y":248,"width":104,"height":27}]},{"text":"그뿐 아니라 이를 이용하면 같은 논리로 동작하는 함수를 중복해서 만들지 않아도 됩니다. 우리가 다루는","words":[{"text":"그뿐","x":271,"y":304,"width":55,"height":25},{"text":"아니라","x":337,"y":301,"width":78,"height":28},{"text":"이를","x":424,"y":302,"width":50,"height":26},{"text":"이용하면","x":485,"y":301,"width":98,"height":28},{"text":"같은","x":595,"y":301,"width":50,"height":27},{"text":"논리로","x":653,"y":301,"width":75,"height":27},{"text":"동작하는","x":738,"y":301,"width":99,"height":28},{"text":"함수를","x":848,"y":301,"width":74,"height":27},{"text":"중복해서","x":931,"y":300,"width":101,"height":29},{"text":"만들지","x":1043,"y":299,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"않아도","x":1128,"y":299,"width":75,"height":28},{"text":"됩니다.","x":1213,"y":299,"width":76,"height":28},{"text":"우리가","x":1298,"y":298,"width":77,"height":29},{"text":"다루는","x":1384,"y":298,"width":75,"height":28}]},{"text":"정릴 알고리즘이 함수 포인터를 응용할 수 있는 좋은 예입니다. 퀵 정렬 알고리즘은 데이터 요소를 비교하는","words":[{"text":"정릴","x":273,"y":352,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"알고리즘이","x":336,"y":351,"width":126,"height":28},{"text":"함수","x":474,"y":351,"width":50,"height":27},{"text"